# JJ jumps

Follow [`docs/jj-jumps.md`](docs/jj-jumps.md).

**Always** tell the user whether finished or proposed work needs a **new Play Store AAB** (`New AAB required` or `No new AAB`, with one-line why). The Capacitor app bundles Vite `dist` (see `docs/play-aab.md`).
